                                "sense_id": "ed095435-e1fb-31f4-82fa-b3605f15ab0f",
                                "text": "Then let these Aristarchs read the geographer Morse; they will then see that the good Penn, however concerned he may have been with spiritual good, did not for all that neglect the goods of this world."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
